  "description": "The eastern clearing follows a bright stream through the forest. Water drops over a short ledge near the upper middle, winds between stones and grassy banks, then falls again towards the lower edge. A light earth path runs alongside it on the right, passing large tree roots and clusters of blue, pink and purple flowers. Vines hang from the upper canopy, and the broad trunks on either side leave the water and path visible through the centre. Sunlight picks out the grassy shelves between the cascades, giving this part of the forest a more open, layered shape.",
